  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∨</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Set equivalent&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∩</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∪</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B)</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi></math><br /><br />Hence answer is&nbsp;<math><mi>p</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>q</mi></math> .",
